  "title": "Basic 1 — 2 — 3 — 4 Cake",
  "description": "A classic 1 — 2 — 3 — 4 cake : 1 cup butter, 2 cups sugar, 3 cups flour, and 4 eggs are the main ingredients in this tender and moist layer cake.",
  "authors": [
    "Janice"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-06-28T22:29:16-04:00",
